able for twelve years. Taxable bonds are those the interest on which is subject to both the normal and surtax rates of the Federal income tax. This average commenced October 20, 1941.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 14, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [766, 1757, 1364, 1830], \"page_id\": 65}], \"content\": \"3/ Average of 9 bonds, January 6, 1933 through December 6, 1935; average of 15 bonds, December 7, 1935 through July 31, 1937; average of 20 bonds, August 1, 1937 through September 13, 1938; average of 5 bonds, September 14, 1938 to date.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 15, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [766, 1833, 1345, 1884], \"page_id\": 65}], \"content\": \"Monthly averages of daily figures except for corporate bonds January 1933 through March 1938, when averages of Saturdays are used.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 16, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [766, 1886, 1349, 1920], \"page_id\": 65}], \"content\": \"5/ On days when the exchanges are closed, the date and prices of the previous day are used.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 17, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [766, 1917, 874, 1942], \"page_id\": 65}], \"content\": \"6/ Holiday.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 18, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [768, 1942, 809, 1960], \"page_id\": 65}], \"content\": \"\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 19, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [812, 1940, 1221, 1958], \"page_id\": 65}], \"content\": \"indicates change in composition of the average.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 20, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [121, 446, 162, 1607], \"page_id\": 66}], \"content\": \"Average Yields of Long-Term Treasury and Corporate Bonds\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"title\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [164, 917, 196, 1145], \"page_id\": 66}], \"content\": \"Monthly Series\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [211, 125,