dividual filings\n\nI'll verify the calculation confirms my understanding: Net = Withheld + Other - Refunds yields 1,004,461, matching the table exactly. This validates the data represents individual income tax receipts, making 997.3 billion dollars the correct answer.\n","signature":""},{"type":"toolRequest","id":"call_04daa39314a3b650","toolCall":{"status":"success","value":{"name":"todo__todo_write","arguments":{"content":"- [x] Find individual income tax receipts data for fiscal years 1929-1942 (net of refunds, in billions)\n- [x] Find individual income tax receipts data for fiscal year 2000 (actual value)\n- [x] Fit OLS linear regression with year as predictor and receipts as outcome\n- [x] Project value for fiscal year 2000\n- [x] Calculate difference (actual - projected)\n- [x] Write final answer to /app/answer.txt"}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"todo"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
